WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.272 --> 00:00:01.572
- Hi, I'm Levar Burton.

00:00:01.572 --> 00:00:04.882
This is my throne of books!

00:00:05.452 --> 00:00:07.070
And, these are some of the most

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:09.415
beautiful quotes in Literature.

00:00:09.415 --> 00:00:11.592
(classical music)

00:00:14.407 --> 00:00:18.146
"At any rate, that is happiness,

00:00:18.146 --> 00:00:19.678
"to be dissolved into something

00:00:19.678 --> 00:00:22.162
complete and great."

00:00:22.627 --> 00:00:26.741
"Isn't it pretty to think so?"

00:00:26.741 --> 00:00:30.642
"He stepped down trying
not to look long at her,

00:00:30.642 --> 00:00:33.986
"as if she were the sun, yet he saw her,

00:00:33.986 --> 00:00:38.026
like the sun even without looking."

00:00:38.026 --> 00:00:39.997
"Whatever our souls are made of,

00:00:39.997 --> 00:00:43.062
"his and mine are the same."

00:00:43.062 --> 00:00:45.268
"There is a sense in which

00:00:45.268 --> 00:00:48.797
"we are all each other's consequences."

00:00:48.797 --> 00:00:52.303
"Let the wild rumpus start!"

00:00:52.303 --> 00:00:54.788
"You don't have to live forever.

00:00:54.788 --> 00:00:58.154
"you just have to live."

00:00:58.154 --> 00:01:02.278
"And the rest is rust and stardust."

00:01:02.798 --> 00:01:07.023
"A dream, all a dream,
that ends in nothing

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:09.864
"and leaves the sleeper where he lay down

00:01:09.864 --> 00:01:14.560
"but I wish you to know
that you inspired it."

00:01:16.446 --> 00:01:21.084
"Journeys end, in lovers meeting."

00:01:21.554 --> 00:01:25.403
"Everything was beautiful
and nothing hurt."

00:01:27.823 --> 00:01:29.962
(classical music)

